(2)   93/  C19A66 :                     ; Called from the main list's VBL handler once the cursor has stayed on a
(2)   94/  C19A66 :                     ; game for a little while. Looks for that game's own bg.bmp (same format/
(2)   95/  C19A66 :                     ; folder convention as CUSTOM_BG_FILENAME) and shows it as the menu
(2)   96/  C19A66 :                     ; background; falls back to the root bg.bmp, then to the default pattern.
(2)   97/  C19A66 :                     ; Does nothing if the highlighted game is already the one currently shown.
