(2)  152/  C19B2A :                     
(2)  153/  C19B2A :                     ; Same as LoadCustomBG but without the "Loading..." fix text overlay — used by
(2)  154/  C19B2A :                     ; LoadGameBG while the file list is already on screen, where stamping that
(2)  155/  C19B2A :                     ; message over the list every time the cursor settles would leave it stuck
(2)  156/  C19B2A :                     ; there (nothing currently clears it outside of the one-time boot sequence).
(2)  157/  C19B2A :                     LoadCustomBGSilent:
(2)  158/  C19B2A :                     	; Decode into whichever buffer is NOT currently on screen. SetupBGSprites
(2)  159/  C19B2A :                     	; only switches to it (BGActiveBuffer) once the whole decode below has
(2)  160/  C19B2A :                     	; succeeded, so a live reload never shows a half-drawn or wrong-palette
(2)  161/  C19B2A :                     	; image - the switch is an atomic flip, not a gradual overwrite.
